    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overview:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action shooter game where the main focus is fighting large enemies (bosses).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the dizzying amount of enemy bullets while dealing damage to the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 stages, boss battles only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't think it's easy to clear, so I've narrowed it down to a low difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First try the easier level, and then try the harder level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appearance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art, 3D background, chiptune</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danmaku, multi-jointed</p>",
